      "content": "Each approach has different equity considerations for your proposal. A lottery ensures randomness, offering purely impartial distribution. Basing allocations strictly on income addresses the need for those with the greatest need. Prioritizing transit enhances access to employment and services, which is a form of opportunity equity. You might consider a hybrid model that weights these factors to achieve the most balanced outcome.",
